{"id": "central-subway-testing-and-delay-claims", "title": "Seven canceled tests and a Central Subway delay claim", "seconds": 64.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "tempo": 1.008, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "d43174834127d7cc", "words": 175, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Seven times, San Francisco set a date to test its new subway. Seven times, it withdrew the date.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.46, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Seven", "canceled", "tests"], "sub": "Central Subway"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.93, 1.19, 1.75, 1.98, 2.06, 2.37, 2.48, 2.83, 3.05, 3.26, 4.25, 4.68, 5.14, 5.27, 5.75, 5.86]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The infrastructure was unfinished or the builder needed the same work site.", "t0": 6.58, "t1": 10.68, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "No access to the track"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.82, 1.06, 1.93, 2.15, 2.27, 2.65, 2.97, 3.09, 3.39, 3.67]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Testing finally started in January 2021. The train-control contractor had been waiting nearly three years.", "t0": 10.8, "t1": 17.65, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The testing window opens"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.85, 1.26, 1.4, 1.95, 2.31, 3.64, 3.84, 4.53, 5.16, 5.28, 5.42, 5.73, 6.04, 6.33]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Board approved $2,491,394 for the delays.", "t0": 17.87, "t1": 21.49, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2,491,394", "label": "Earlier delay claim"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.39, 0.8, 1.06, 1.27, 1.56, 1.88, 2.23, 2.65, 2.81, 2.92]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The agency said it had already settled with the builder and would not pursue that money.", "t0": 21.61, "t1": 25.71, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The earlier settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.66, 0.9, 1.01, 1.18, 1.54, 1.9, 2.04, 2.13, 2.56, 2.72, 2.9, 3.07, 3.48, 3.7]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A separate package paid for design changes and faster delivery.", "t0": 25.83, "t1": 29.56, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Five payment milestones"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.57, 1.09, 1.35, 1.5, 1.92, 2.47, 2.68, 3.13]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Then a different payment left a paper trail. The builder had withheld money from the train-control contractor.", "t0": 29.68, "t1": 35.97, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The retained payment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.28, 0.62, 1.05, 1.31, 1.39, 1.74, 2.92, 3.11, 3.51, 3.65, 4.12, 4.42, 4.61, 4.7, 5.47]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "A City voucher shows $705,407.80 paid to the vendor.", "t0": 36.09, "t1": 42.35, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$705,407.80", "label": "Voucher 0220446701"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.48, 0.9, 1.21, 1.56, 1.99, 2.34, 2.85, 3.15, 3.52, 3.85, 4.26, 4.39, 4.74, 5.18, 5.52, 5.63, 5.74]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The construction closeout shows an equal credit to the City. It covered the withheld money.", "t0": 42.57, "t1": 47.76, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "An equal credit on the builder’s contract"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.77, 1.31, 1.58, 1.72, 2.07, 2.43, 2.53, 2.65, 3.5, 3.72, 4.12, 4.24, 4.79]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The Board later approved another settlement for 136 days of delays, including a substation fire.", "t0": 47.88, "t1": 54.57, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "136", "label": "Additional days"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.52, 0.84, 1.3, 1.65, 2.16, 2.4, 2.64, 3.03, 3.72, 4.03, 4.14, 4.73, 5.28, 5.36, 6.17]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The train-control system was ready before full passenger service began in January 2023.", "t0": 54.69, "t1": 60.52, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The opening date"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.86, 1.25, 1.46, 1.8, 2.16, 2.45, 3.03, 3.43, 3.93, 4.1, 4.63, 5.03]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 60.64, "t1": 63.23, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.96, 1.28, 1.38, 1.47, 1.77, 2.09]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Seven testing dates", "b": "A claim and a voucher", "o": "What the credit covered"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "question"}